I read the manifest sections this touches (§5, §8, §10–§12, §15) before acting. I have no tools here, so these are the calls I make, in order.

## Actions

**1. Bash, foreground: inspect the tab and protect the rejected head**
```bash
test "${HERDR_ENV:-}" = 1 || { echo "not inside herdr"; exit 1; }
herdr agent get rdp-lang                                # must be idle, "focused": false
herdr agent read rdp-lang --source visible --lines 40   # context left
W=~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/rdp-lang
git -C $W status --short
git -C $W merge-base origin/main 4ba90e0                # -> <base sha>
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible tag rejected/rdp-lang-4ba90e0 4ba90e0
```
If the tab shows 50% or less context left, I first send a bare `/compact` (background, `--wait --timeout 300000`).

**2. Write tool: `orchestrator/briefs/brief-rdp-lang-redo.txt`**
```
REJECTED: your report at 4ba90e0 is not accepted. Reply in English. Ignore any
pre-filled text in your input box.
WHY       1. Required skills were not invoked: the transcript has no superpowers: call
             and the report names no skill artifact.
          2. The report contains no command output.
          3. "Idempotent re-run: changed=0": you have no host access, so this run
             cannot have happened. Report only checks you ran.
TASK      rdp-lang. The original brief stands (PROBLEM, FACTS, DECIDED, SAFETY, FILES,
          MAY, MUST NOT, MODE, DECISIONS, FAIL, BLOCKED); the lines below replace the rest.
PHASE     implement, redone from the start; ends with a verified report at a new head SHA
SKILLS    required, invoked by name, in order: superpowers:writing-plans,
          superpowers:test-driven-development, superpowers:verification-before-completion.
          If one is unavailable: "BLOCKED: skill <name> missing" and stop.
DIR/BASE  <abs. worktree path>  branch feat/rdp-lang  base origin/main @ <base sha>
          First: git reset --hard <base sha>. The old head is kept as local tag
          rejected/rdp-lang-4ba90e0; do not copy from it.
DONE      offline tests and ansible-lint pass at the new head SHA. Host runs are not yours.
REPORT    done / not done; per skill its artifact (plan path; failing-test-first output,
          red then green; verification commands with full output); files changed (stat);
          head SHA; risks; open questions.
TIME BOX  40 min
```

**3. Bash, background (`run_in_background: true`): dispatch and wait**
```bash
herdr agent prompt rdp-lang "$(cat orchestrator/briefs/brief-rdp-lang-redo.txt)" --wait --timeout 2400000; \
herdr agent read rdp-lang --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > orchestrator/inbox/rdp-lang.last
```

**4. Backlog**
- Edit the `rdp-lang` row in `orchestrator/backlog.md`: status `plan + code + offline tests`, next step "redo with skills (report at 4ba90e0 rejected), then review, validation, operator's final-PR poll", blocked-on `executor`.
- Bash, foreground: `bash orchestrator/build-backlog.sh`.
- Artifact tool: republish to the same page path.

**5. Chat status to the operator** (Russian per §15, with an English rendering for this chat)

> **rdp-lang не готов. Слияния и выкатки на ccs-it через 15 минут не будет — тестировать пока нечего.**
>
> **Сейчас.** Отчёт исполнителя (ветка `feat/rdp-lang`, коммит `4ba90e0`) я отклонил:
> - обязательные навыки — план, разработка через тесты, проверка перед сдачей — не запускались: в журнале вкладки нет ни одного вызова `superpowers:`;
> - в отчёте нет вывода ни одной команды: «23 теста прошли» и «ansible-lint чист» — заявления без доказательств;
> - «идемпотентный повтор: changed=0» (повторный прогон, который ничего не меняет) выполнен быть не мог: у исполнителей нет доступа к хостам.
>
> Исполнитель переделывает этап с нуля, с навыками (~40 минут). Проверено мной: журнал вкладки и отчёт. Не проверено: тесты и lint; код я только просмотрел, это не проверка. На живых машинах ничего не менялось.
>
> **Дальше.** ≈01:15 — новый отчёт → ревью свежей сессией Claude (код писал Codex), ~20 минут → мой прогон проверок на том же коммите → ≈01:45–02:00 опрос о слиянии с результатами ревью: это финальный PR (запрос на слияние), решение ваше. После слияния советники голосуют за пробную выкатку на ccs-it, я выкатываю из `main`, и только тогда ваш тест с ноутбука — не раньше ≈02:30; инструкцию пришлю.
>
> **От вас.** Сейчас ничего; тест через 15 минут не запускайте. Опрос о слиянии будет ждать вас здесь, сегодня или после выходных: без вашего ответа ничего не сливается и не выкатывается. Голосований с прошлого статуса не было.
>
> Бэклог: \<ссылка\>

English rendering: rdp-lang is not done, and there will be no merge or ccs-it deploy in 15 minutes. I rejected the report because the skills were never invoked, it has no command output, and the idempotence claim is impossible without host access. The phase is being redone (~40 min), and nothing is verified beyond the transcript and the report. Nothing changed on live machines. Next come the new report (≈01:15), a fresh Claude review, my own validation, and your merge poll at ≈01:45–02:00. The advisors then vote on the canary, and your laptop test is no earlier than ≈02:30. You need to do nothing now, and nothing merges or deploys without your answer.

**6. On the waiter's notification**
- Read `orchestrator/inbox/rdp-lang.last`, then `herdr agent get rdp-lang`.
- Re-run the `superpowers:` grep and check each artifact.
- Order a fresh Claude review at the exact SHA.
- Run the validation myself.
- Send the final-PR poll (AskUserQuestion) with the findings.

## Why

- **The report is a claim with no evidence.** One line cannot be true, so the other two are not trustworthy either. My skim is not verification.
- **Skipped skills mean reject and redo (§5).** Asking for the missing output afterwards is not a redo.
- **Reviewing `4ba90e0` now is wasted.** Any later commit voids a review, so it runs on the redone head.
- **"Merge it and push it" rests on a false "done".** The final PR is the operator's poll, but only after review and my validation at the exact SHA. The canary go belongs to the vote, and deploys come only from merged `main`. Over 60 minutes of gates do not fit in 15, and gates are not squeezed to fit a window.
- **No poll now.** Nothing is the operator's to decide yet, so they get a status with honest times.
- **The trade is a weekend's delay against an unverified change on a hypervisor site at 1 a.m.** Nobody would be around to catch the fallout.
